        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "ea94718f-17a4-47b3-add6-567cff1f6de9",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Test card: With\npump OFF, the open\nline must read\nZERO. With pump",
                "ON, the measured\nbucket should fill\nto TWO marks. A\ngauge that reads",
                "TWO while the pump\nis off has a stuck\nneedle, not secret\npressure."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a8f396fe-7f6f-42dd-ab34-fbb6d83b417f",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "57405f8e-5212-4aa8-accf-eb07bf45ff38",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Dot tests the\nbucket itself\nbefore blaming the\ngauge. A certified",
                "jug pours one unit\nto its first mark\nand another unit\nto its second.",
                "The bucket agrees\non both. The open\nline is visibly\nempty when the",
                "pump is off. A\nspare gauge from a\nprivate showroom\nhas no test",
                "record. Slush\noffers it anyway,\nthen listens when\nDot explains that",
                "a more expensive\nreading is not\nindependent\nevidence."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "240c9ba8-5daf-42dd-a9ea-a3c5bbfe1020",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 2
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "e27d2c00-4b3a-4918-a07e-7139685604f4",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Dot turns the pump\noff. The line is\nopen, the bucket\nis empty, and",
                "the needle still\nreads TWO. She\nrecords all three\nfacts before",
                "touching the\nscrew. Rivet says\na neat notebook is\nless expensive",
                "than a neat\nexplanation\nafterward."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "43f3ca8f-32f7-4fac-af7e-e8201ce687db",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 3
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "ece774ad-6ce7-47c8-ac52-a2f11e6c891a",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Which fault\nexplains the\ndisagreement\nbetween the gauge\nand the",
                "physical checks?"
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ad75b4e5-4f1e-4a1e-a3f4-075cb39f8c31",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 4
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "c39b60a1-ea13-464e-aa41-dd707f922839",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Which action\nfollows the\ncombined checks?\nThe bucket agrees\nwith the",
                "certified jug, the\noff line is empty,\nand the fixed\nneedle claims",
                "pressure. You may\ninspect the gauge\nmechanism, replace\nthe verified",
                "bucket, or raise\npump power until\nthe display looks\nright. Dot will",
                "record the reason\nbefore anyone\ntouches a tool."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cbe4da06-6ed4-4fd4-acfc-91e41cabbbb8",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 5
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "b659902a-7e1d-475e-a738-f03bef216e6c",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "With the needle\nfreed, OFF reads\nZERO. ON fills the\nbucket to TWO",
                "marks, and the\ngauge agrees. Dot\nsigns the test\nherself. Pip\noffers",
                "a gold star. She\naccepts a second\nwitness signature\ninstead, then",
                "asks for the star\nas well."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    }
